==Turkish==

===Etymology===
From {{cog|otk||𐰲𐰆𐰲𐰸|tr=čočuk|t=piglet}}, from {{der|tr|trk-pro|*čōč-||child; young pig}}; from which also {{m|trk-pro|*čōčka||pig}}.

Cognate with {{cog|az|çocuq||child}}, {{cog|uz|jujuq||small child}}.

